Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.50,0:00:08.55,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}在需要这项检查的兵士定义分支，游戏追到
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.43,0:00:09.44,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}In troop-definition branches requiring this check, the game traces
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.55,0:00:12.61,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}兵员真正的来源角色，读取那个人的军事补
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.44,0:00:12.90,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}the soldiers to their actual source character, reads that
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.61,0:00:16.24,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}员开关，并继续检查资源和位置条件。
